# Module API

Copy `modules/auth/api`: `handler.ts`, `local.ts`, `app.ts`, `controllers/`, `config/env.ts` (Zod via `env-config`).

- Routes `/<slug>/...`. `/health` comes from `@namma-medmate/lambda-bootstrap` — do not reimplement it.
- Own `contract/swagger.yaml` + `contract/implemented-routes.json`. One controller file per operation.
- No `db/` folder. No nested enterprise factories.

```ts
// BAD
app.get('/api/v1/auth/session', factory.create('session').handle);

// GOOD — auth-api style
// controllers/get-session.controller.ts attached at /auth/session
```
